  "title": "Chilled Tomato and Pepper Soup",
  "blurb": "A refreshing cold soup made from blended ripe tomatoes, sweet peppers and spring onions, with a hint of garlic.",
  "steps": [
    "Roughly chop the tomatoes and place them in a blender.",
    "Remove the seeds and white membrane from the pepper, chop it roughly, and add to the blender.",
    "Trim the spring onions, chop them roughly, and add to the blender along with the peeled garlic cloves.",
    "Add the olive oil, vinegar, salt and cold water to the blender.",
    "Blend everything until completely smooth, then taste and add more salt if needed.",
    "Pour the soup through a sieve into a bowl if you prefer a smoother texture, or leave as is for more body.",
    "Cover and chill in the fridge for at least two hours before serving."
